            },
            "description": "Demonstrates custom OpenAI configuration options.\n\n**Configuration Options:**\n- **temperature**: Controls randomness (0.0-2.0)\n  - Lower = more focused and deterministic\n  - Higher = more creative and random\n- **maxTokens**: Maximum response length\n- **model**: Specific model to use\n\n**Why configure options:**\n- Different tasks need different creativity levels\n- Cost control through token limits\n- Performance optimization\n\n**Trade-offs:**\n- Higher temperature = more creative but less predictable\n- More tokens = better responses but higher cost\n- Newer models = better quality but higher cost"
          },
